    <item>
      <title>Coherence Engineering in Semiconductor Spin Qubits</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/my_personal_website/experience/demo-invited-talk-eth-zurich/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/my_personal_website/experience/demo-invited-talk-eth-zurich/</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>An invited talk covering our recent results on <strong>coherence engineering</strong> in
Si/SiGe double quantum dots, including the dependence of $T_2^*$ on isotopic
purification and the trade-off against valley splitting.</p>
<p>This entry demonstrates everything at once: captions, tags, prose, and a
multi-photo grid.</p>
]]></description>
    </item>
